Scratch area for Rust exercises, independent of pluk.

Add src/bin/foo.rs, then:
  cargo run --bin foo            # build (debug) and run
  cargo run --bin foo -- ARGS    # pass arguments
  cargo build --release --bin foo   # binary in target/release/foo

Crates: cargo add <crate>  (adds to Cargo.toml, available to all exercises)
